  "details": "On live and in previous betas you were always able to close the Quick Menu by starting to move with the joystick. On 1489 nothing will happen instead. You first need to close the Quick Menu using the menu button and then you can move again.\n\n- Using Quest 2 with touch controllers and virtual desktop (Forward tracking data disabled)\n\n- I have reset my bindings after updating to 1489\n\nI'd like to see the old behavior restored or a toggle added.",
